+## Dissent Review
+
+Run this **before** the self-review checklist — it can force a restructuring change, so the cheap structural checks should run on the plan you keep. This is the first fresh eyes on the plan side.
+
+Invoke the `dissent-review` skill with `artifact=plan` and the plan path. It dispatches a cold dissent reviewer against the decomposition — a wrong task shape, a spec requirement no task covers, over-built tasks, a step that won't survive contact — collects your honest per-finding responses, dispatches a neutral adjudicator, and folds back apply / skip / ask. A finding big enough to restructure the plan comes back as `ask`; decide it with the user before continuing. If dissent could not run, it surfaces a loud "dissent did NOT run on `<path>`" notice — carry that to the user.

